---
import ProjectLayout from '../../layouts/ProjectLayout.astro';
import HolidayCalendar from '../../components/HolidayCalendar.astro';
import { calendarProject } from '../../data/projects';
---
<ProjectLayout project={calendarProject} wideStage hideIntro>
  <HolidayCalendar />
  <Fragment slot="details">
    <h2>数据来源</h2>
    <p>放假与调休安排整理自国务院办公厅公告（via <a href="https://github.com/lanceliao/china-holiday-calender" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">china-holiday-calender</a>），农历、节气与节日来自 <a href="https://github.com/6tail/lunar-javascript" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">lunar-javascript</a>。</p>
  </Fragment>
</ProjectLayout>
